            array (
                'id' => 1,
                'slug' => 'rector',
                'title' => '{"en":"Rector\'s Message","km":"\\u179f\\u17b6\\u179a\\u1796\\u17b8\\u179f\\u17b6\\u1780\\u179b\\u179c\\u17b7\\u1791\\u17d2\\u1799\\u17b6\\u1792\\u17b7\\u1780\\u17b6\\u179a"}',
            'content' => '"{\\"rector_name\\":{\\"en\\":\\"H.E. DR. KHEM Phearun\\",\\"km\\":\\"\\\\u17af\\\\u1780\\\\u17a7\\\\u178f\\\\u17d2\\\\u178f\\\\u1798\\\\u1794\\\\u178e\\\\u17d2\\\\u178c\\\\u17b7\\\\u178f \\\\u1781\\\\u17c2\\\\u1798 \\\\u1797\\\\u17b6\\\\u179a\\\\u17bb\\\\u1793\\"},\\"rector_title\\":{\\"en\\":\\"The Rector of the Digital University of Cambodia\\",\\"km\\":\\"\\\\u179f\\\\u17b6\\\\u1780\\\\u179b\\\\u179c\\\\u17b7\\\\u1791\\\\u17d2\\\\u1799\\\\u17b6\\\\u1792\\\\u17b7\\\\u1780\\\\u17b6\\\\u179a \\\\u1793\\\\u17c3\\\\u179f\\\\u17b6\\\\u1780\\\\u179b\\\\u179c\\\\u17b7\\\\u1791\\\\u17d2\\\\u1799\\\\u17b6\\\\u179b\\\\u17d0\\\\u1799\\\\u178c\\\\u17b8\\\\u1787\\\\u17b8\\\\u1790\\\\u179b\\\\u1780\\\\u1798\\\\u17d2\\\\u1796\\\\u17bb\\\\u1787\\\\u17b6\\"},\\"paragraphs_en\\":\\"<p>As the Rector of the Digital University of Cambodia, I am thrilled and honored to lead an institution of higher education at the forefront of innovation in this rapidly evolving field of technology. In this fast-paced digital era, the need for continuous learning and adaptation to new discoveries is absolutely vital. This requires us to constantly run forward in developing new curricula to keep pace with the latest advancements in the AI era, especially in cyber security, data science pipelines, and many other fields. I believe that the future of technology lies in the hands of those who not only possess technical skills, but also have the vision to apply these tools in creative and effective ways.<\\\\\\/p><p>The field of digital technology is no longer just an academic subject; instead, it is the foundation of modern digital society, driving progress in every sector and institution\\\\u2014be it industry, agriculture, engineering, architecture, economics, or other fields ranging from healthcare and education to entertainment, digital marketing, and digital finance.<\\\\\\/p><p>At our university, we recognize that while our digital technology is new and still at its initial training stage, we are actively participating in addressing some of the most complex challenges of digital literacy facing our nation and the world. Whether it is developing advanced artificial intelligence, improving cybersecurity, building sustainable smart cities, or driving next-generation digital experiences, our faculty, students, and researchers are at the heart of this global societal transformation. Our mission is to provide a comprehensive, rich education that goes beyond theory, equipping our students with practical, hands-on skills and a visionary mindset characterized by excellence, dynamism, ethics, virtue, and a high spirit of patriotism.<\\\\\\/p><p>Our university emphasizes practical learning, internships, modern cutting-edge research, and close cooperation with the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports. This ensures that our graduates are not only well-versed in the latest technologies but also fully prepared to lead the way in building definitive digital skills for future generations.<\\\\\\/p><p>I would like to offer a motto: \\\\\\"The future of digital technology is the brilliance of every individual\'s life.\\\\\\" To achieve this, it is only through hard work, study, learning, curiosity, and creative research that we can unlock ignorance or digital illiteracy and strive to develop its full potential\\\\u2014whether you are just starting your journey or are an industry professional seeking advanced knowledge. Our university provides an environment where everyone can observe, learn, explore, and conduct practical research in the field of digital technology.<\\\\\\/p><p>I encourage all of you to join our university in exploring the limitless possibilities of digitalization. Together, we can drive forward-thinking solutions that will positively impact our society and the world.<\\\\\\/p>\\",\\"paragraphs_km\\":\\"<p>\\\\u1780\\\\u17d2\\\\u1793\\\\u17bb\\\\u1784\\\\u1793\\\\u17b6\\\\u1798\\\\u1787\\\\u17b6\\\\u179f\\\\u17b6\\\\u1780\\\\u179b\\\\u179c\\\\u17b7\\\\u1791\\\\u17d2\\\\u1799\\\\u17b6\\\\u1792\\\\u17b7\\\\u1780\\\\u17b6\\\\u179a\\\\u1793\\\\u17c3\\\\u179f\\\\u17b6\\\\u1780\\\\u179b\\\\u179c\\\\u17b7\\\\u1791\\\\u17d2\\\\u1799\\\\u17b6\\\\u179b\\\\u17d0\\\\u1799\\\\u178c\\\\u17b8\\\\u1787\\\\u17b8\\\\u1790\\\\u179b\\\\u1780\\\\u1798\\\\u17d2\\\\u1796\\\\u17bb\\\\u1787\\\\u17b6\\\\u1781\\\\u17d2\\\\u1789\\\\u17bb\\\\u17c6\\\\u1798\\\\u17b6\\\\u1793\\\\u179f\\\\u17c1\\\\u1785\\\\u1780\\\\u17d2\\\\u178f\\\\u17b8\\\\u179a\\\\u17c6\\\\u1797\\\\u17be\\\\u1794\\\\u179a\\\\u17b8\\\\u1780\\\\u179a\\\\u17b6\\\\u1799 \\\\u1793\\\\u17b7\\\\u1784\\\\u1798\\\\u17b6\\\\u1793\\\\u1780\\\\u17b7\\\\u178f\\\\u17d2\\\\u178f\\\\u17b7\\\\u1799\\\\u179f \\\\u178a\\\\u17c2\\\\u179b\\\\u1794\\\\u17b6\\\\u1793\\\\u178a\\\\u17b9\\\\u1780\\\\u1793\\\\u17b6\\\\u17c6\\\\u179f\\\\u17d2\\\\u1790\\\\u17b6\\\\u1794\\\\u17d0\\\\u1793\\\\u17a7\\\\u178f\\\\u17d2\\\\u178f\\\\u1798\\\\u179f\\\\u17b7\\\\u1780\\\\u17d2\\\\u179f\\\\u17b6\\\\u1798\\\\u17bd\\\\u1799 \\\\u1793\\\\u17c5\\\\u1787\\\\u17bd\\\\u179a\\\\u1798\\\\u17bb\\\\u1781\\\\u1793\\\\u17c3\\\\u1780\\\\u17b6\\\\u179a\\\\u1785\\\\u17d2\\\\u1793\\\\u17c3\\\\u1794\\\\u17d2\\\\u179a\\\\u178c\\\\u17b7\\\\u178f\\\\u1793\\\\u17c5\\\\u1780\\\\u17d2\\\\u1793\\\\u17bb\\\\u1784\\\\u179c\\\\u17b7\\\\u179f\\\\u17d0\\\\u1799\\\\u1794\\\\u1785\\\\u17d2\\\\u1785\\\\u17c1\\\\u1780\\\\u179c\\\\u17b7\\\\u1791\\\\u17d2\\\\u1799\\\\u17b6\\\\u178a\\\\u17c2\\\\u179b\\\\u1798\\\\u17b6\\\\u1793\\\\u1780\\\\u17b6\\\\u179a\\\\u179c\\\\u17b7\\\\u179c\\\\u178f\\\\u17d2\\\\u178f\\\\u1799\\\\u17c9\\\\u17b6\\\\u1784 \\\\u1786\\\\u17b6\\\\u1794\\\\u17cb\\\\u179a\\\\u17a0\\\\u17d0\\\\u179f\\\\u1793\\\\u17c1\\\\u17c7\\\\u17d4 \\\\u1793\\\\u17c5\\\\u1780\\\\u17d2\\\\u1793\\\\u17bb\\\\u1784\\\\u179c\\\\u17b7\\\\u179f\\\\u17d0\\\\u1799\\\\u178c\\\\u17b8\\\\u1787\\\\u17b8\\\\u1790\\\\u179b \\\\u178a\\\\u17c2\\\\u179b\\\\u1798\\\\u17b6\\\\u1793\\\\u1780\\\\u17b6\\\\u179a\\\\u179c\\\\u17b7\\\\u179c\\\\u178f\\\\u17d